  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NGO Lead Rapid response programme : Strategic assistance for emergency responses in the Democratic Republic of Congo (SAFER)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The programme supports the specific outcome of delivering a coordinated humanitarian response that enables vulnerable households affect by conflict and shocks to have safe and equitable access to multi sectoral emergency assistance and basic water, Sanitation and Hygiene services to reduce reliance on negative coping mechanisms.</narrative>
  </description>
